# T_SCRE: no memory for the item pick list of a new loan's item prompt:
# the prompt ends, "Not enough memory" left on the hint row.  The next
# new loan's prompt, its ITEM GET refused by the server, asks again with
# the refusal still on the hint row: the pick list that could not open
# ends only its own prompt.
K INS
K ENTER
T IBM
K ENTER
S NOMEM
K INS
K ENTER
T 1
K ENTER
S AGAIN
K ESC
K ESC
